OL,3,ABomb threats reported against multiple
OL,4,Aflights across Europe for second time
OL,5,Athis week
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, at least seven flights were
OL,8,Fhit by similar threats - no explosives
OL,9,Fwere found
